openrsvp (0.1.1-0ubuntu1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Packaging fix: drop debian/compat so debhelper compat 13 is declared only
    via Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13). Modern debhelper rejects
    having both. New upstream version forced because Launchpad will not
    accept a re-upload sharing an orig tarball with an already-uploaded
    source version.

 -- George Cottrell <georgecottrell@email.com>  Tue, 28 Apr 2026 12:55:00 +0000

openrsvp (0.1.0-0ubuntu1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Rapid Serial Visual Presentation reader.
    - PDF main-text extraction with column detection and header/footer dedup
    - Mozilla Readability for HTML / URLs / EPUB cleanup
    - DOCX (mammoth), legacy DOC (word-extractor), TXT, Markdown
    - Spritz-style ORP highlighting, smart pacing, 1/2/3-word chunks
    - Per-document bookmarks, visual start-position picker

 -- George Cottrell <georgecottrell@email.com>  Tue, 28 Apr 2026 10:30:00 +0000
